  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 AF4007 Afghanistan Acute Crisis Joint Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This intervention addresses urgent shelter, NFI, and protection needs of Afghan returnees arriving through IQ border and to be settled within their districts of origin in Herat province. At the point of entry, the project will deliver case management support, referrals, and follow-up, to ensure continuity of care at districts of return. There, it will provide Shelter Kits, repair support, NFIs, and protection services for children, survivors of SGBV, and individuals at risk.</narrative>
  </description>
